<title>USA: Santa Anita gets offer from Apollo, Koll.</title>
<headline>Santa Anita gets offer from Apollo, Koll.</headline>
<dateline>ARCADIA, Calif. 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Santa Anita Cos said on Wednesday it will consider an unsolicited offer it received from Apollo Real Estate Advisors and The Koll Co.</p>
<p>Koll and Apollo said earlier today that they are proposing an investment of $50 million into Santa Anita and would commit to subsequent investments of up to $150 million.</p>
